# Living documentation

## Required files

| File | Purpose | Update when |
| --- | --- | --- |
| `docs/architecture.md` | System overview, component map | New component, service, or structural pattern |
| `docs/decisions.md` | ADRs | Non-trivial technical choice |
| `docs/skills.md` | Reusable project patterns | A new pattern succeeds or an old one changes |
| `docs/mistakes.md` | Errors and prevention rules | After every mistake or failed approach |
| `docs/onboarding.md` | Setup and navigation | Setup steps or project structure change |

## Bootstrap

If a required file is missing, copy the matching stub from `.cursor/bootstrap/docs/` into `docs/` and add a brief initial entry.

## Behaviour

- Update `docs/architecture.md` before closing any task that changes architecture.
- Add ADRs to `docs/decisions.md` using the format in that file.
- Keep docs concise, current, and limited to what is implemented.
- Do not create markdown outside the `docs/` convention unless the user asks.
